  "text": "If invoicing clients feels like pulling teeth, this tool does it from a voice memo. Freelancers waste Sunday afternoons piecing together scribbled notes and Slack timestamps to calculate billable hours. Delayed billing triggers unpredictable cash flow, forgotten project add-ons, and painful payment disputes. Speak a thirty-second memo into AudioPen to automatically parse rambling tasks into itemized Stripe invoices. You get invoices paid in twenty-four hours.",
